              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ذات مرة — dhāta marra — \"once, one time\". It opens a story: ذات مرة كانت هنا بحيرة — dhāta marra kānat hunā buḥayra — \"Once there was a lake here.\" كانت is the past of to be."
            }
          ]
        },
